{"3584060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BONEBUILDER", "steam_appid": 3584060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5174470], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>***BONEBUILDER IS CURRENTLY IN BETA***</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >***Current version includes 10 bosses and 60-120 minutes of gameplay***</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the small indie studio Vector Warrior comes their first game BONEBUILDER.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this action roguelike you will fight imposing enemies in heavy, deliberate third-person 3D action combat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584060/extras/d7fec8e3a6715997379311a5c13345cc.poster.avif?t=1788262663\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584060/extras/d7fec8e3a6715997379311a5c13345cc.webm?t=1788262663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584060/extras/d7fec8e3a6715997379311a5c13345cc.mp4?t=1788262663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect bones and weapons from defeated enemies to build the most powerful skeleton possible through BONEBUILDER's unique crafting and talent systems!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584060/extras/71c683d28f5921454ee4d41990bf4951.poster.avif?t=1788262663\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584060/extras/71c683d28f5921